# Base URL of the legacy PHP API (api/v2). When set, the frontend rewrites
# its /api/* calls to this PHP backend (see src/lib/queryClient.ts).
# Leave UNSET to use the built-in Node api-server at /api/* instead.
#
# Local development (PHP built-in server on port 8090):
VITE_PHP_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/v2
#
# Production: set this in the Vercel dashboard to your PHP host's HTTPS URL, e.g.
# VITE_PHP_API_BASE=https://php.example.com/api/v2
# Do NOT commit a real .env.local — copy this file to .env.local for local use.
